**Undo and redo
u = to undo last changes
ctrl+r = to redo the changes

**Deletion, cut, copy and paste
dd = delete current line
<n>dd = delete n lines from the current line
10dd = delete 10 lines from current line
dw = delete a word
<n>dw = delete n words

cc = cut current line
<n>cc = cut n lines
cw = cut word
<n>cw = cut n words

yy = copy current line
<n>yy = copy n lines
yw = copy a word
<n>yw = copy n words

p = to paste cut/copied lines
<n>p = to paste n times

Visual mode:

d = delete
c = cut
y = copy
p = paste
u = convert capital letter to small letter
shift + u = convert small letters to capital lettters
~ = convert small to capital and vice versa

commands:
shift + h = move cursor to the top of the screen
shift + m = move cursor to the middle of the screen
shift + l = move cursor to the bottom of the screen
shift + i = insert text at the start of line
a = append text after the currrent char
shift + a = append text at the end of the line
o = open a new line below
shift + o = open a new line above



